g\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xyN0hmi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">合并附魔是一个<strong>服务端</strong>模组，您可以混合、排除甚至合并所有附魔。例如：锋利、亡灵杀手和节肢杀手，所有类型的保护（火焰、爆炸和弹射物），精准采集和时运，激流与引雷/忠诚，致密、破甲、亡灵杀手和节肢杀手。请查阅<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>了解配置如何运作，您可以设置<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑名单</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">合并所有附魔</a>。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/H9nhuOr.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/l717aDK.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"234\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>常见问题解答</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：它与其他模组的附魔兼容吗？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：自v3.0起，可以合并所有原版及外部模组的附魔。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何同时获得<span style=\"color:#008000\">精准采集</span>和<span style=\"color:#9c0\">时运</span>？</strong><br>答：您需要安装合并附魔和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toggle-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">切换附魔</a>。<br><strong>问：如何同时获得<span style=\"color:#36f\">激流</span>、<span style=\"color:#f60\">忠诚</span>和<span style=\"color:#fc0\">引雷</span>？</strong><br>答：您需要安装合并附魔和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-trident-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">改进三叉戟附魔</a>。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：这是客户端还是服务端模组？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：自v4.2起，此模组仅作为服务端模组使用。<br><strong>问：我可以在我的整合包中包含合并附魔吗？</strong><br>答：当然可以，只需将我的模组放入相关项目即可。</span></li>\n</ul>",
